    <Replace Tag="LOC_SDP_STATES_TOOLTIP" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Must: always placed. Pool: when the count is above the required number, the best of the pool are picked. Off: left out. Districts are compared by weighted adjacency, plus land, reach and distance when on, plus Housing for Neighborhoods and Preserves (and tile yields for a Must Preserve). Encampments and Aerodromes have no adjacency bonus and are never picked from the pool: make them Must. Districts limited to one per empire (Government Plaza, Diplomatic Quarter) are Must or Off only.</Text>
